  m_text: "The turn order is the way the game operates and who is able to play because
    the card game is a turn based game. \n\nThe turn order is seperated between the
    Players turn and the Opponents turn. The turn order starts with the Players turn,
    then becomes the Opponents turn, then the player again and this loop continues
    until a winner is declaired. "
